    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3428000/extras/3b31ea974006da55a19ff2a420dfe75f.webp?t=1749418966\" width=600 height=39 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In recent months, an eerie stillness has fallen over the city. Women are vanishing without a trace, only to be found later in the forest \u2014 heartless, marked with a burned noose on their bodies. The police are helpless, and the locals dare not speak of it aloud.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are an artist, once inspired, now cursed. Your dreams have turned into vivid nightmares, visions of things that shouldn\u2019t exist\u2026 or perhaps already have. Ancient forces whisper through your mind, growing stronger, closer \u2014 as if something is trying to break through, using you as its vessel.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Where does reality end and madness begin? Can you uncover the truth behind the victims before losing yourself? Or are you just a brush in the hand of darkness?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3428000/extras/50f3f656475cbc54518911f0179e1238.webp?t=1749418966\" width=600 height=39 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Vorozhey</strong> is shrouded in an atmosphere of ominous silence, where reality dissolves into ancient myths and personal nightmares. The creaking floorboards, whispers from the dark, and haunting visions make you question your own sanity.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3428000/extras/1c7de0b26f326dbee5ef80c70c6c9ad7.webp?t=1749418966\" width=600 height=39 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Psychological horror</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Slavic mythology</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Uncover the mystery of the city</p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3428000/extras/3b31ea974006da55a19ff2a420dfe75f.webp?t=1749418966\" width=600 height=39 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In recent months, an eerie stillness has fallen over the city. Women are vanishing without a trace, only to be found later in the forest \u2014 heartless, marked with a burned noose on their bodies. The police are helpless, and the locals dare not speak of it aloud.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are an artist, once inspired, now cursed. Your dreams have turned into vivid nightmares, visions of things that shouldn\u2019t exist\u2026 or perhaps already have. Ancient forces whisper through your mind, growing stronger, closer \u2014 as if something is trying to break through, using you as its vessel.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Where does reality end and madness begin? Can you uncover the truth behind the victims before losing yourself? Or are you just a brush in the hand of darkness?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3428000/extras/50f3f656475cbc54518911f0179e1238.webp?t=1749418966\" width=600 height=39 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Vorozhey</strong> is shrouded in an atmosphere of ominous silence, where reality dissolves into ancient myths and personal nightmares. The creaking floorboards, whispers from the dark, and haunting visions make you question your own sanity.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3428000/extras/1c7de0b26f326dbee5ef80c70c6c9ad7.webp?t=1749418966\" width=600 height=39 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Psychological horror</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Slavic mythology</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Uncover the mystery of the city</p></li></ul>",
